      "value": "<p><br/></p><div class=\"plugin-tabmeta-details conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-name=\"details\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"d2d75310-30dd-4418-b8d5-97624852a722\" data-content-id=\"459896146\" data-content-version=\"10\"><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Status</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><span class=\"jira-issue conf-macro output-block\" data-jira-key=\"AD-2452\" data-client-id=\"SINGLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_459896146_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"jira\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"c93a6758-52d5-4eea-b8ca-8f27b09a2c6e\" data-content-id=\"459896146\" data-content-version=\"10\">\n                    <a href=\"https://mu--se.atlassian.net/browse/AD-2452\" class=\"jira-issue-key\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-wait issue-placeholder\"></span>AD-2452</a>\n                            -\n            <span class=\"summary\">Getting issue details...</span>\n                                                <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-default issue-placeholder\">STATUS</span>\n                </span></p></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">DRI / Project owner</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"a.danchenko\" href=\"/display/~a.danchenko\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50919004\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Alexander Danchenko</a>&nbsp;</p></div></td></tr><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Team</th><td class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><p><a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"a.danchenko\" href=\"/display/~a.danchenko\" data-linked-resource-id=\"50919004\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Alexander Danchenko</a> <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"s.karukes\" href=\"/display/~s.karukes\" data-linked-resource-id=\"210241326\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Sergey Karukes</a> <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"p.petkilev\" href=\"/display/~p.petkilev\" data-linked-resource-id=\"206144975\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Unknown User (p.petkilev)</a> <a class=\"confluence-userlink user-mention\" data-username=\"r.starikov\" href=\"/display/~r.starikov\" data-linked-resource-id=\"276344876\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"userinfo\" data-base-url=\"https://alice.mu.se\">Roman Starikov</a>&nbsp;</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-name=\"toc\" data-host-id=\"23d33a86-c149-3b82-a91a-c47ce220f3e1\" data-macro-id=\"5614d8d2-d0ff-4a5f-b90f-38432e58c650\" data-content-id=\"459896146\" data-content-version=\"10\"></div></p><h1 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-ResearchandContext\">Research and Context</h1><ul><li><strong>Project goal:</strong> Add interstitial in direct sales on Artists</li></ul><h1 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-ReleaseGoal\">Release Goal</h1><p>Introduce the ability to show interstitials before tabs of specific artists.</p><h1 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-DescriptionoftheSolution\">Description of the Solution</h1><p>The idea is to show interstitials on specific artists, the result of whether to show will be received from the backend</p><h1 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-A/B\">A/B</h1><p><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/components/ab/experiment/view?id=4716\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.ultimate-guitar.com/components/ab/experiment/view?id=4716</a></p><p><br/></p><h3 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-APIRequirements\">API Requirements</h3><h4 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-Functionality:\">Functionality:</h4><p>В ответ запроса &quot;<span style=\"color:var(--ds-background-accent-red-subtle,#f87168);\">ads/config</span>&quot;, добавить поле artistsForDirectSales = [], где в случае если нужно сделать предзагрузку интерстишл возвращать список id артистов</p><p>Результат ответа будет зависеть от геопозиции, времени и продолжительности, следовательно нужна какая-то админка, где можно будет динамически изменять и дополнять информацию о показе прямых продаж на интерстишелах</p><p><s>Пример: Я захожу в админку, выбираю количество стран, старт и финиш показа прямых продаж, Музыкантов и Страны, где нужно будет показывать прямые продажи.</s></p><p>UPD <time datetime=\"2024-06-10\" class=\"date-past\">10 Jun 2024</time> пример: заходим в админку и выбираем только артистов, на которых показываем интерстишелы, все остальные настройки делаем через GAM</p><p>Музыканты: AC/DC, Metallica</p><h1 id=\"id-[20240604]UGinAPP:Directsalesininterstitials[20240806]-Execution\">Execution</h1><p><strong><div id=\"refresh-module--1905094567\" class=\"refresh-module-id jira-table conf-macro output-block\" data-client-id=\"TABLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_459896146_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010_cGFyZW50PUFELTI0NTIgIG9yZGVyIGJ5IGtleSAgICAgIA==_aXNzdWV0eXBlc3VtbWFyeWFzc2lnbmVlY3VzdG9tZmllbGRfMTAzMTJkdWVkYXRlc3RhdHVz\" data-jira-key=\"issue-table-TABLE_d1985a03-3c98-365b-8107-f4cdc34a26f1_459896146_308924de99aa6c1f019a81a6ac900010_cGFyZW50PUFELT